      "text": "Another week, another reminder: RWA isn’t slowing down, it’s accelerating.\n\nThe pace of tokenization this week was wild. From billion-dollar raises to major regulatory moves, the financial system is clearly shifting onchain.\n\nHere’s a breakdown of what you need to know 👇\nAn interview spotted Robinhood’s CEO saying that “tokenization will eat the entire financial system.”\n\nAnd with the total stablecoin supply surging by $45 billion in just three months, that statement doesn’t sound far-fetched.\n\nMajor Institutional Moves:\n- ISDA explores tokenized collateral to boost market resilience.\n- Coinbase applies for a federal trust bank license, though they insist, “we don’t want to be a bank.”\n- ECB gains support for a ban on multi-issuance stablecoins.\n- Intercontinental Exchange (ICE) plans to invest up to $2B in Polymarket.\n- PayPal’s PYUSD stablecoin hits $1B market cap via Spark partnership.\n- Tether eyes $200M for tokenized gold reserves.\n- Plume Network earns SEC Transfer Agent status, bridging TradFi to blockchain.\n- Avalanche Treasury Co. announces $675M business combination with Mountain Lake.\n\nGlobal & Regulatory Landscape:\nIn the U.S., policymakers are discussing Bitcoin reserves and crypto tax relief, while New York launches a $12K digital asset pilot for low-income youth.\n- Europe pushes for tighter stablecoin rules as the ECB advances the Digital Euro.\n- Across Asia & MENA, countries are going full speed ahead:\n- Pakistan launches a state-owned digital wallet company.\n- Thailand expands crypto ETFs.\n- Vietnam embraces asset tokenization.\n- The Philippines passes digital asset framework.\n- Hong Kong extends tokenized equity compliance deadlines.\n\nAcquisitions and alliances are just as impressive:\n- Ondo Finance → Oasis Pro\n- Uniswap Labs → Guidestar\n- Deutsche Börse x Chainlink — Onchain market data\n- Consensys x Swift — Tokenization prototype\n- FG Nexus x Securitize — Public share tokenization\n- OpenZeppelin x ADI Foundation — Dirham-backed stablecoin\n\nTradFi and Web3 are officially shaking hands. 🤝\n\nThe Bigger Picture:\nBlackRock’s BUIDL now sits at $600M AUM, and confidential lending is paving the way for institutional liquidity in DeFi.\n\nBillions are flowing in, regulators are adapting, and the next financial era is being built in real time.\n\nMy final Thought:\nTokenization isn’t the future of finance anymore, it’s the evolution of finance happening before our eyes.\n\nFollow @_mikepreneur for weekly RWA insights, trends, and tokenization breakdowns. \n\nLet’s make sense of this shift, one block at a time. ⚡",
